{"id":2252,"date":"2024-07-02T16:32:49","date_gmt":"2024-07-02T09:32:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/?p=2252"},"modified":"2024-07-03T07:56:36","modified_gmt":"2024-07-03T00:56:36","slug":"penandatanganan-perjanjian-kerja-sama-foshan-polytechnic-dan-pppvi-bpsdmi-kementerian-perindustrian-di-politeknik-stmi-jakarta","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/penandatanganan-perjanjian-kerja-sama-foshan-polytechnic-dan-pppvi-bpsdmi-kementerian-perindustrian-di-politeknik-stmi-jakarta\/","title":{"rendered":"Penandatanganan Perjanjian Kerja Sama Foshan Polytechnic dan PPPVI BPSDMI Kementerian Perindustrian di Politeknik STMI Jakarta"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Penandatanganan Perjanjian Kerja Sama antara Foshan Polytechnic dan Pusat Pengembangan Pendidikan Vokasi Industri BPSDMI Kementerian Perindustrian yang dilaksanakan di Ruang Rapat Politeknik STMI Jakarta pada Jumat, 28 Juni 2024.<\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2253 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture1-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture1-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture1.jpg 924w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Kegiatan penandatanganan perjanjian kerja sama diawali dengan sambutan dari Foshan Polythecnic oleh Mr. Zhao Yinsheng selaku Vice President Foshan Polytechnic.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2254 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture2-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture2-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture2.jpg 693w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Selanjutnya, sambutan Kepala Pusat Pengembangan Pendidikan Vokasi Industri oleh Ibu Wulan Aprilianti Permata Sari<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2255 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture3-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture3-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture3.jpg 693w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Pada penandatangan kerja sama kemarin, ada beberapa rangkaian kegiatan yang diikuti oleh semua peserta meliputi Presentasi Profil Politeknik STMI Jakarta, Presentasi Hydrogen Energy Report dan Presentasi A Brief Introduction On Hydrogen Refueling Starion dari Foshan Polytechnic, serta kunjungan ke Workshop Politeknik STMI Jakarta.<\/p>\n<p>Kegiatan pertama yaitu pemaparan dan presentasi profil kampus Politeknik STMI Jakarta oleh Bapak Amrin Rapi, S.T., M.T selaku Direktur Politeknik STMI Jakarta.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2256\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture4-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture4-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture4.jpg 693w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Kegiatan selanjutnya merupakan presentasi tentang Hydrogen Energy Report oleh Mr. Tang Rong dari Foshan\u00a0Polytechnic.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2257 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture5-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture5-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture5.jpg 693w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Selanjutnya, merupakan presentasi mengenai A Brief Introduction on Hydrogen Refueling Starion oleh Mr. Hu Wenyong dari Foshan Polytechnic.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2258 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture6-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture6-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture6.jpg 693w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Setelah kegiatan pemaparan dan presentasi dari kedua kampus, maka dilanjutkan penandatanganan perjanjian kerja sama antara Pusat Pengembangan Pendidikan Vokasi Industri dan Foshan Polytechnic.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2259\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture7-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture7-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture7.jpg 693w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Diakhir seluruh kegiatan, seluruh peserta melakukan kunjungan ke Workshop Politeknik STMI Jakarta.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2260 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture8-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture8-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture8.jpg 693w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2261 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture9-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture9-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture9.jpg 693w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2262 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture10-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture10-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture10.jpg 693w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Penandatanganan Perjanjian Kerja Sama antara Foshan Polytechnic dan Pusat Pengembangan Pendidikan Vokasi Industri BPSDMI Kementerian Perindustrian yang dilaksanakan di Ruang Rapat Politeknik STMI Jakarta pada Jumat, 28 Juni 2024. Kegiatan penandatanganan perjanjian kerja sama diawali dengan sambutan dari Foshan Polythecnic oleh Mr. Zhao Yinsheng selaku Vice President Foshan Polytechnic. Selanjutnya, sambutan Kepala Pusat Pengembangan Pendidikan [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":2259,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[28,22],"tags":[23],"class_list":["post-2252","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-berita","category-berita-kampus","tag-berita-kampus"],"blocksy_meta":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2252","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/